 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "第二类风险，来自代币本身。",
   "spoken": "第二类风险，来自代币本身。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "ERC-20 只规定了接口，没有规定行为。",
   "spoken": "ERC-20 只规定了接口，没有规定行为。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.916,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 5.014,
   "speechEnd": 8.061
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "常见的非标准行为，有八种。",
   "spoken": "常见的非标准行为，有八种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.12,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 9.218,
   "speechEnd": 11.575
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "一，transfer 不返回值，比如以太坊上的 USDT。用 SafeERC20 兼容。",
   "spoken": "一，transfer 不返回值，比如以太坊上的 USDT。用 SafeERC20 兼容。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 12.628,
   "dur": 7.872,
   "speechStart": 12.726,
   "speechEnd": 19.676
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "二，transfer 成功了，却返回 false。这是 TRON 上的 USDT。",
   "spoken": "二，transfer 成功了，却返回 false。这是 TRON 上的 USDT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.72,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 20.818,
   "speechEnd": 26.28
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "三，转账收税。到账的钱，比转出的少。",
   "spoken": "三，转账收税。到账的钱，比转出的少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.348,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 27.446,
   "speechEnd": 31.61
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "四，余额自动变化，比如 stETH。缓存的余额会失效，要用份额记账。",
   "spoken": "四，余额自动变化，比如 stETH。缓存的余额会失效，要用份额记账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.656,
   "dur": 7.872,
   "speechStart": 32.754,
   "speechEnd": 39.692
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "五，黑名单和冻结。",
   "spoken": "五，黑名单和冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 40.748,
   "dur": 2.904,
   "speechStart": 40.846,
   "speechEnd": 42.822
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "六，可暂停。",
   "spoken": "六，可暂停。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.872,
   "dur": 2.352,
   "speechStart": 43.97,
   "speechEnd": 45.386
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "七，转账钩子，比如 ERC-777，会带来重入。",
   "spoken": "七，转账钩子，比如 ERC-777，会带来虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 46.444,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 46.542,
   "speechEnd": 51.149
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "八，可升级。行为以后可能改变。",
   "spoken": "八，可升级。行为以后可能改变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.208,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 52.306,
   "speechEnd": 55.625
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "细看第二种。OpenZeppelin 在 2026 年，审计了 Across 协议的 TRON 部署。",
   "spoken": "细看第二种。OpenZeppelin 在 2026 年，审计了 Across 协议的 TRON 部署。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 56.7,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 56.798,
   "speechEnd": 62.76
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "TRON 上的 USDT，转账成功时，也返回 false。",
   "spoken": "TRON 上的 USDT，转账成功时，也返回 false。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.832,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 63.93,
   "speechEnd": 68.12
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "于是，用 safeTransfer 推送 USDT 的代码，在 TRON 上一律回滚。",
   "spoken": "于是，用 safeTransfer 推送 USDT 的代码，在 TRON 上一律回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 69.164,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 69.262,
   "speechEnd": 74.464
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "存款走拉取方向的 transferFrom，不受影响。",
   "spoken": "存款走拉取方向的 transferFrom，不受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 75.528,
   "dur": 4.104,
   "speechStart": 75.626,
   "speechEnd": 78.792
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "症状就是：存款正常，提款全部失败。",
   "spoken": "症状就是：存款正常，提款全部失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 79.852,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 79.95,
   "speechEnd": 83.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "修复是不读返回值，只看接收方的余额涨了多少。",
   "spoken": "修复是不读返回值，只看接收方的余额涨了多少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 84.656,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 84.754,
   "speechEnd": 88.492
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "涨的正好等于金额，才算到账。",
   "spoken": "涨的正好等于金额，才算到账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 89.556,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 89.654,
   "speechEnd": 92.201
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "这个方案假设不收手续费。而 Tether 保留了开启它的能力。",
   "spoken": "这个方案假设不收手续费。而 Tether 保留了开启它的能力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 93.256,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 93.354,
   "speechEnd": 98.149
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "再看第三种，收税代币。",
   "spoken": "再看第三种，收税代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 99.212,
   "dur": 3.024,
   "speechStart": 99.31,
   "speechEnd": 101.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "协议按参数记账：用户说存 100，账上就记 100。",
   "spoken": "协议按参数记账：用户说存 100，账上就记 100。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 102.456,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 102.554,
   "speechEnd": 106.899
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "可代币扣了税，金库实际只收到 98。",
   "spoken": "可代币扣了税，金库实际只收到 98。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 107.956,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 108.054,
   "speechEnd": 110.982
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "账面比实收多出 2 枚。这个差额，由其他用户承担。",
   "spoken": "账面比实收多出 2 枚。这个差额，由其他用户承担。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 112.04,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 112.138,
   "speechEnd": 116.814
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "所有用户都这样存取，协议就会资不抵债。",
   "spoken": "所有用户都这样存取，协议就会资不抵债。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 117.876,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 117.974,
   "speechEnd": 121.212
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "修复是按实收记账：转账前后，各读一次余额，只记增量。",
   "spoken": "修复是按实收记账：转账前后，各读一次余额，只记增量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-24.mp3",
   "start": 122.272,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 122.37,
   "speechEnd": 127.286
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-25",
   "text": "这一步要配合重入锁，防止回调干扰前后两次读数。",
   "spoken": "这一步要配合虫入锁，防止回掉干扰前后两次读数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-25.mp3",
   "start": 128.348,
   "dur": 4.896,
   "speechStart": 128.446,
   "speechEnd": 132.398
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-26",
   "text": "没有一个库，能防住所有怪代币。",
   "spoken": "没有一个库，能防住所有怪代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-26.mp3",
   "start": 133.464,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 133.562,
   "speechEnd": 136.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-27",
   "text": "审计时，先问项目方：你们支持哪些代币？",
   "spoken": "审计时，先问项目方：你们支持哪些代币？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-27.mp3",
   "start": 137.236,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 137.334,
   "speechEnd": 141.095
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-28",
   "text": "不支持的类型，比如收税和变基，要显式拒绝。",
   "spoken": "不支持的类型，比如收税和变基，要显式拒绝。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-28.mp3",
   "start": 142.44,
